# Reflected light (GI): shots and clips of the places where it shows, for the review of step 2 of the ray-tracing
# revisit (reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/step-2.md). Run it once per variant, the same window:
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=0                  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-clips
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-clips
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=2  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-clips
# gi-reference.bench is the path-traced reference of the same shots: change both together.
# Every shot X is taken twice: as the player sees it, and X-bare without the hero, the npc and the particles
# (view hide animated morph pfx), which the ray scene and so the reference lack (step 2b-2, step-2b.md). A shot is
# written with the next frame drawn: the view changes a frame after it (wait 200), or the shot shows the change.
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off

# 1. The candle- and torch-lit harbour house of perf-interior at night (views 2 and 3: the hearth, the shelves):
#    fire light bounces off the walls, the corners away from it stay dark, no sky comes in; a slow pan.
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 160 170 270
wait 10000
cam hold
shot interior-night-1
wait 200
view hide animated morph pfx
wait 1000
shot interior-night-1-bare
wait 200
view full
wait 3000
cam world 160 170 180
wait 300
cam hold
shot interior-night-2
wait 200
view hide animated morph pfx
wait 1000
shot interior-night-2-bare
wait 200
view full
rec interior-night-pan
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn 60 8000
wait 1000
stop

# 2. A plank hut of the harbour's poor quarter: thin walls (light leaks), the sun through the gaps and the door at
