# 9. Leak views (step 2b-2): thin plank walls of the harbour's poor quarter, thinner than a probe cell of lod 0.
#    A lamp inside hut 1 behind its north wall at night, the camera outside; the fireplace of hut 3 behind its north
#    wall at night, the camera in the alley outside (the open door lets some of it out); the west wall of hut 6 in
#    the noon sun, the camera inside on its shaded side. A wall the reference leaves nearly black is no test: its
#    cells are left out of the comparison. The view of hut 1 keeps the sacks at its corner out of the frame: the
#    raster lamp's own light lights them through the planks (its shadow, not the probes; step-2b.md, «2б-2»).
set time 23 0
